Program-4 Print 1 to 10 by using do-while loop?
#include<iostream>
using namespace std;
int main()
{
int i=1;
do
{
cout<<i<<" ";
i++;
}
while(i<=10);
}



Program-5 Print 1 to 10 using for while loop?
